# The pause screen in a race of 12 cars (docs/port/MORECARS.md 10.3): one player and 11 drones (game.cars at 12, the
# Drones option raised through the track select), the screens the pause menu opens, then a retirement from it, which
# ends the race: _EndGame, the results, the game over screen (as pause.press).
# until: 0x800000:60
# seconds: 120
# visits: 0x2000000
# expect: state=0x00800000: players 1, windows 1, cars 12, mode 0, track 0, pause 0
# args: --set game.cars=12
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 DOWN 0.1    # the track select: down its options list to the Drones
20.5 DOWN 0.1
21 RIGHT 0.1   # the Drones: 5 to 11
21.5 RIGHT 0.1
22 RIGHT 0.1
22.5 RIGHT 0.1
23 RIGHT 0.1
23.5 RIGHT 0.1
25 A           # track 0
28 A           # the car select; the race from about 28.6 s, its countdown to 32 s
35 START       # pause
36 DOWN 0.1    # its second item
37 A           # the screen it opens
40 B           # back to the pause menu
41 DOWN 0.1    # the third item
42 A
45 B
46 DOWN 0.1    # the fourth
47 A
50 B
51 DOWN 0.1    # the fifth
52 A
55 B
56 DOWN 0.1    # down to quit (item 7)
56.5 DOWN 0.1
57 DOWN 0.1
58 A           # quit: are you sure?
59 RIGHT 0.1   # yes
60 A           # the race is retired: _EndGame, the results, the game over screen
